  "description": "Analysis code (R) for long-term eddy-covariance CO2 and water-flux measurements at the Tambopata National Reserve, southwestern Amazonia, Peru (AmeriFlux site PE-TNR; AndesFlux/PUCP), 2017-2024. Accompanies Stern et al., 'Long-Term Flux Measurements in Southwestern Amazonia Reveal a Near-Neutral CO2 Balance and Unique Effects of El Nino-Southern Oscillation', Global Change Biology (submitted). The aggregated processed data underlying the figures and tables, and the half-hourly record, are archived as separate Zenodo dataset records; the curated long-term record is released via AmeriFlux.",
